  "slug": "prestar-pedir-prestado",
  "titulo": "To lend and to borrow: prestar and pedir prestado",
  "subtitulo": "¿Me prestas tu tabla? / Te pedí prestada la tabla.",
  "foto": "t03.jpg",
  "regla": "To lend = prestar (agrees with the lender): ¿me prestas…? To borrow = pedir prestado (prestado agrees with the thing): ¿te puedo pedir prestadas tus herramientas?",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "English has two verbs, _to lend_ and _to borrow_. Spanish uses **prestar** and **pedir prestado**:"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "English",
            "Spanish",
            "Who's the subject"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "to lend",
              "prestar",
              "the one who lends"
            ],
            [
              "to borrow",
              "pedir (algo) prestado",
              "the one who borrows"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The most common way to ask to borrow something is actually with **prestar**: **¿me prestas tu pluma?** (_will you lend me your pen?_), often with **poder**: **¿me puedes prestar…?**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "With **pedir prestado**, **prestado** works like an adjective and **agrees with the thing**: **prestado**, **prestada**, **prestados**, **prestadas**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **prestar** gives; **pedir prestado** asks. And **prestado** dresses like the thing you borrowed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "¿==Me prestas== tu pluma, por favor?",
              "en": "Will you lend me your pen, please?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Me puedes prestar== tu tabla el sábado?",
              "en": "Can you lend me your board on Saturday?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Beto ==me prestó== su chamarra porque tenía frío.",
              "en": "Beto lent me his jacket because I was cold."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Crees que Naomi nos ==prestaría== sus audífonos?",
              "en": "Do you think Naomi would lend us her headphones?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Te puedo ==pedir prestado== tu carro?",
              "en": "Can I borrow your car?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Te puedo ==pedir prestadas== tus herramientas?",
              "en": "Can I borrow your tools?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi vecina ==me pidió prestada== la aspiradora y no me la ha regresado.",
              "en": "My neighbor borrowed my vacuum and hasn't given it back."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
